00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:07.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
Again, not real.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:08.781 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:09.582 line:92%
But, yeah, it bummed people out.

00:04:09.582 --> 00:04:12.318
But it was still fun to do,
and now Lautner and I --

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:13.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we talk about it
all the time.

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:14.954
-Oh, definitely.
-Yeah, 'cause we hang out a lot.

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:18.157
-That dress audience talks about
it all the time, too.

